  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-junio-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean las matrices \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&m&3\\\\4&1&-m\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\3&2\\\\-1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}5&-3&4\\\\-3&-2&2\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,5 p.) Indica los valores de \\(m\\) para los que \\(A\\) es invertible.",
     "(2 p.) Resuelve la ecuación matricial \\(XA-B^t=C\\) para \\(m=0\\). (\\(B^t\\) es la matriz traspuesta de \\(B\\))."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(A\\) es invertible si y solo si \\(|A|\\neq0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\0&m&3\\\\4&1&-m\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- m^{2}+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(- 4 m+3+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-m^2+4m-3=-(m-1)(m-3)\\]<div class='res'>\\(A\\) es invertible si \\(m\\neq1\\) y \\(m\\neq3\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(XA=C+B^t\\). Con \\(m=0\\), \\(|A|=-3\\neq0\\), así que multiplico por \\(A^{-1}\\) por la derecha<i class='n' data-t='err'>\\(X\\) multiplica a \\(A\\) por la izquierda, así que \\(A^{-1}\\) va a la derecha.</i>: \\(X=(C+B^t)A^{-1}\\).</p>\\[A=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & -1\\\\0 & 0 & 3\\\\4 & 1 & 0\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad|A|=-(0-1)(0-3)=-3\\ \\text{(apartado a)}\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & 12 & 0\\\\-1 & 4 & -1\\\\0 & -3 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=-\\frac1{3}\\begin{pmatrix}-3 & -1 & 0\\\\12 & 4 & -3\\\\0 & -1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0\\\\-4 & - \\frac{4}{3} & 1\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[C+B^t=\\begin{pmatrix}5 & -3 & 4\\\\-3 & -2 & 2\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 3 & -1\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & 0 & 3\\\\-3 & 0 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & 0 & 3\\\\-3 & 0 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0\\\\-4 & - \\frac{4}{3} & 1\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & 3 & 0\\\\-3 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & 3 & 0\\\\-3 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "inv",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ecmat",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
