  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-junio-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) de ecuaciones \\(x-1=y=1-z\\) y \\(\\begin{cases}x-2y=-1\\\\y+z=1\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) Determina su punto de corte.",
     "(1 p.) Halla el ángulo que forman \\(r\\) y \\(s\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que contiene a \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\equiv(1+t,\\,t,\\,1-t)\\). Paso \\(s\\) a paramétricas: con \\(y=\\mu\\), \\(x=-1+2\\mu\\), \\(z=1-\\mu\\). Igualo coordenadas:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}1+t=-1+2\\mu\\\\t=\\mu\\\\1-t=1-\\mu\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow1+t=-1+2t\\iff t=2=\\mu\\]<div class='res'>Se cortan en \\(P(3,2,-1)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El ángulo entre dos rectas es el agudo que forman sus directores<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(\\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac{|\\vec u\\cdot\\vec v|}{|\\vec u|\\,|\\vec v|}\\).</i>: \\(\\vec u=(1,1,-1)\\), \\(\\vec v=(2,1,-1)\\).</p>\\[\\cos\\alpha=\\frac{|2+1+1|}{\\sqrt3\\,\\sqrt6}=\\frac4{\\sqrt{18}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt2}3\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\alpha=\\arccos\\dfrac{2\\sqrt2}3\\approx19{,}47^\\circ\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&1&-1\\\\2&1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=(0,\\,-1,\\,-1)\\parallel(0,1,1)\\]<p>El plano es de la forma \\(y+z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(P(3,2,-1)\\): \\(1+D=0\\iff D=-1\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":87,\"el\":44,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1.6,0.717,0.283],[5.4,0.717,0.283],[5.4,3.483,-2.483],[1.6,3.483,-2.483]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[5.4,3.483,-2.483],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[1.6,0.6,0.4],[4.4,3.4,-2.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[4.4,3.4,-2.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1.0,1.0,0.0],[5.0,3.0,-2.0],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[5.0,3.0,-2.0],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"pt\",[3,2,-1],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m10ja4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m10ja4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m10ja4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m10ja4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='231.4,27.0 26.0,34.4 33.8,246.0 239.3,238.5' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='37.8' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='231.1' y1='18.0' x2='87.7' y2='237.7' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='93.7' y='237.7' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='264.7' y1='47.4' x2='54.1' y2='208.3' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='60.1' y='208.3' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='159.4' cy='127.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='166.4' y='121.8' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.0' y2='270.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.6' y='274.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.8' y2='281.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='22.1' y='289.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='258.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='258.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(260.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(y+z-1=0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
