  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-junio-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{e^x-e^{\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}}{x^2}\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es una indeterminación \\(\\frac00\\). Aplico la regla de L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{e^x-e^{\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}}{x^2}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{e^x-\\cos x\\,e^{\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}}{2x}=\\left[\\frac00\\right]\\]\\[\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{e^x+\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\,e^{\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}-\\cos^2x\\,e^{\\mathrm{sen}\\,x}}2=\\frac{1+0-1}2=0\\]<div class='res'>El límite vale \\(0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "lim",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2010-JUNIO.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-junio-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(f\\) dada por \\(f(x)=5-x\\) y la función \\(g\\) definida como \\(g(x)=\\dfrac4x\\) para \\(x\\neq0\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\) indicando sus puntos de corte.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área de dicho recinto."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es una recta decreciente y \\(g\\) una hipérbola (en \\(x\\gt0\\), decreciente y positiva). Cortes:</p>\\[5-x=\\frac4x\\iff5x-x^2=4\\iff x^2-5x+4=0\\iff x=1\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=4\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='80.7,70.7 83.9,73.0 87.2,75.4 90.4,77.8 93.7,80.2 96.9,82.5 100.2,84.9 103.4,87.3 106.7,89.7 109.9,92.0 113.2,94.4 116.4,96.8 119.7,99.2 122.9,101.5 126.2,103.9 129.4,106.3 132.7,108.7 135.9,111.0 139.2,113.4 142.4,115.8 145.7,118.2 148.9,120.5 152.2,122.9 155.4,125.3 158.7,127.7 161.9,130.0 165.2,132.4 168.4,134.8 171.7,137.2 174.9,139.5 178.2,141.9 181.4,144.3 184.7,146.7 187.9,149.0 191.2,151.4 194.4,153.8 197.7,156.2 200.9,158.5 204.2,160.9 207.4,163.3 210.7,165.7 210.7,165.7 207.4,165.1 204.2,164.4 200.9,163.8 197.7,163.1 194.4,162.4 191.2,161.7 187.9,160.9 184.7,160.1 181.4,159.2 178.2,158.4 174.9,157.4 171.7,156.5 168.4,155.5 165.2,154.4 161.9,153.3 158.7,152.1 155.4,150.9 152.2,149.5 148.9,148.1 145.7,146.7 142.4,145.1 139.2,143.4 135.9,141.7 132.7,139.8 129.4,137.7 126.2,135.5 122.9,133.2 119.7,130.7 116.4,127.9 113.2,125.0 109.9,121.7 106.7,118.2 103.4,114.3 100.2,110.0 96.9,105.2 93.7,99.9 90.4,93.9 87.2,87.2 83.9,79.5 80.7,70.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='69.8,28.4 73.3,44.9 76.8,58.4 80.3,69.7 83.8,79.3 87.3,87.6 90.8,94.8 94.4,101.1 97.9,106.6 101.4,111.6 104.9,116.0 108.4,120.1 111.9,123.7 115.4,127.0 118.9,130.0 122.4,132.8 125.9,135.3 129.4,137.7 132.9,139.9 136.4,141.9 139.9,143.8 143.4,145.6 146.9,147.2 150.4,148.8 153.9,150.2 157.4,151.6 160.9,152.9 164.4,154.1 167.9,155.3 171.4,156.4 174.9,157.4 178.4,158.4 181.9,159.4 185.4,160.3 188.9,161.1 192.4,161.9 195.9,162.7 199.4,163.5 202.9,164.2 206.4,164.9 209.9,165.5 213.4,166.2 216.9,166.8 220.5,167.4 224.0,167.9 227.5,168.5 231.0,169.0 234.5,169.5 238.0,170.0 241.5,170.4 245.0,170.9 248.5,171.3 252.0,171.8 255.5,172.2 259.0,172.6 262.5,173.0 266.0,173.3 269.5,173.7 273.0,174.0 276.5,174.4 280.0,174.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,26.3 145.7,118.2 271.3,210.0' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='80.7' cy='70.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='86.7' y='66.7'>(1,4)</text><circle cx='210.7' cy='165.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='216.7' y='161.7'>(4,1)</text><text x='245.3' y='162.5' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>g</text><text x='50.3' y='32.7' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='12'>f</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 197.3H294.0M37.3 224.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='80.7' y1='194.3' x2='80.7' y2='200.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='77.7' y='211.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='124.0' y1='194.3' x2='124.0' y2='200.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='121.0' y='211.3' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='167.3' y1='194.3' x2='167.3' y2='200.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='164.3' y='211.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='210.7' y1='194.3' x2='210.7' y2='200.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='207.7' y='211.3' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='254.0' y1='194.3' x2='254.0' y2='200.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='251.0' y='211.3' font-size='10'>5</text><line x1='34.3' y1='165.7' x2='40.3' y2='165.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='21.3' y='169.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='34.3' y1='134.0' x2='40.3' y2='134.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='21.3' y='138.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='34.3' y1='102.3' x2='40.3' y2='102.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='21.3' y='106.3' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='34.3' y1='70.7' x2='40.3' y2='70.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='21.3' y='74.7' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='34.3' y1='39.0' x2='40.3' y2='39.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='21.3' y='43.0' font-size='10'>5</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((1,4)\\) y \\((4,1)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre 1 y 4 la recta queda por encima (en \\(x=2\\): \\(3\\gt2\\)):</p>\\[A=\\int_1^4\\left(5-x-\\frac4x\\right)dx=\\Bigl[5x-\\frac{x^2}2-4\\ln x\\Bigr]_1^4=(12-4\\ln4)-\\frac92=\\frac{15}2-8\\ln2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{15}2-8\\ln2\\approx1{,}955\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
