  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-junio-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}\\lambda x+y+z=\\lambda+2\\\\2x-\\lambda y+z=2\\\\x-y+\\lambda z=\\lambda\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Discútelo según los valores de \\(\\lambda\\). ¿Tiene siempre solución?",
     "(0,75 p.) Resuelve el sistema para \\(\\lambda=-1\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A=\\begin{pmatrix}\\lambda&1&1\\\\2&-\\lambda&1\\\\1&-1&\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}\\lambda&1&1&\\lambda+2\\\\2&-\\lambda&1&2\\\\1&-1&\\lambda&\\lambda\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda&1&1\\\\2&-\\lambda&1\\\\1&-1&\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- \\lambda^{3}+1-2\\bigr)-\\bigl(- \\lambda- \\lambda+2 \\lambda\\bigr)\\]\\[=-\\lambda^3-1=-(\\lambda+1)(\\lambda^2-\\lambda+1)\\]<p>\\(\\lambda^2-\\lambda+1\\) no tiene raíces reales (discriminante \\(1-4\\lt0\\)), así que \\(|A|=0\\iff\\boxed{\\lambda=-1}\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\). <b>Compatible determinado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=-1\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1&1&1&1\\\\2&1&1&2\\\\1&-1&-1&-1\\end{array}\\right)\\). La tercera fila es la primera cambiada de signo y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}-1&1\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-3\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq-1\\): compatible determinado; si \\(\\lambda=-1\\): compatible indeterminado. Sí, siempre tiene solución</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\lambda=-1\\) me quedo con las dos primeras ecuaciones:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}-x+y+z=1\\\\2x+y+z=2\\end{cases}\\]<p>Restando: \\(3x=1\\iff x=\\frac13\\). Con \\(z=t\\): \\(y=1+x-z=\\frac43-t\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac13,\\ y=\\dfrac43-t,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
