  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-junio-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Los puntos \\(P(2,0,0)\\) y \\(Q(-1,12,4)\\) son dos vértices de un triángulo. El tercer vértice \\(S\\) pertenece a la recta \\(r\\) de ecuación \\(\\begin{cases}4x+3z=33\\\\y=0\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula las coordenadas del punto \\(S\\) sabiendo que \\(r\\) es perpendicular a la recta que pasa por \\(P\\) y \\(S\\).",
     "(1 p.) Comprueba si el triángulo es rectángulo."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(r\\) a paramétricas: con \\(x=3\\lambda\\), \\(z=11-4\\lambda\\), \\(y=0\\); director \\(\\vec d=(3,0,-4)\\). Un punto de \\(r\\) es \\(S(3\\lambda,0,11-4\\lambda)\\) e impongo \\(\\overrightarrow{PS}\\perp\\vec d\\):</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{PS}=(3\\lambda-2,\\ 0,\\ 11-4\\lambda),\\qquad\\overrightarrow{PS}\\cdot\\vec d=9\\lambda-6-44+16\\lambda=25\\lambda-50=0\\iff\\lambda=2\\]<div class='res'>\\(S(6,0,3)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\overrightarrow{PQ}=(-3,12,4),\\qquad\\overrightarrow{PS}=(4,0,3),\\qquad\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{PS}=-12+0+12=0\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-117,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"line\",[1.2,0.0,9.4],[9.0,0.0,-1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[9.0,0.0,-1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[2,0,0],[-1,12,4],[6,0,3]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[5.28,0.0,2.46],[5.82,0.0,1.74],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[5.82,0.0,1.74],[6.54,0.0,2.28],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.792,0.831,0.277],[2.512,0.831,0.817],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.512,0.831,0.817],[2.72,0.0,0.54],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[2,0,0],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,12,4],\"Q\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[6,0,3],\"S\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 244' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m10jb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m10jb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m10jb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m10jb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='174.6' y1='18.0' x2='314.0' y2='184.8' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='184.8' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><polygon points='188.9,190.1 26.0,45.6 260.4,120.7' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='247.5' y1='133.2' x2='257.2' y2='144.7' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='257.2' y1='144.7' x2='270.0' y2='132.2' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='177.6' y1='180.1' x2='190.5' y2='167.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='190.5' y1='167.6' x2='201.8' y2='177.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='188.9' cy='190.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='195.9' y='184.1' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='45.6' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='39.6' font-weight='700'>Q</text><circle cx='260.4' cy='120.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='267.4' y='114.7' font-weight='700'>S</text><line x1='24' y1='214' x2='38.3' y2='211.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40.2' y='214.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='214' x2='16.7' y2='208.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='11.2' y='210.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='214' x2='24.0' y2='199.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='198.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,236)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,236)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,236)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Sí: el triángulo es rectángulo en \\(P\\)</div></div>"
    }
